{"ID":"20240118144953-sl405tu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144953-sl405tu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144953-sl405tu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144953-b22pvnj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170617-xnr6325\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170617-xnr6325\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:56,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:56\u0026#125;","title":"377补20猪胆猪肤","type":"doc","updated":"20240204165951"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144953-b22pvnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144953-b22pvnj","updated":"20240122170553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170558-jsoou73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170558-jsoou73"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】猪胆汁味苦性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170559-fbik3ct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170559-fbik3ct"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】主清心明目，凉肝胆，治目赤目翳，小儿疳瘦，著名方剂有猪胆汁方。（用猪胆汁和醋少许，灌入谷道中，少顷大便出宿垢），治阳明热结于下，大便不通者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170605-4de9qwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170605-4de9qwk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一次一枚。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170607-y9c6sn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170607-y9c6sn6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】寒实者禁忌。[猪肤煮米粉，治喉咙化脓长疮。]"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170555-0ygg570","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170555-0ygg570"}},{"ID":"20240122170608-ghjwmul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170608-ghjwmul"}},{"ID":"20240122170616-ubplpud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170616-ubplpud","updated":"20240204165945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第20是猪胆、猪肤，猪胆汁味苦性寒没有毒，主要主清心明目，凉肝胆，那老师那猪胆汁真拿起来喝啊，不是哦，张仲景猪胆汁不是拿起来喝。你的胆汁已经很苦了，还找猪的胆汁来喝，我们知道那熊胆，南派的，拿去治疗肝病，那我治肝病从来不用熊胆，不用，不需用熊胆汁，那我们那个猪胆汁呢是润肠用的，有时候病人体很虚，汤剂攻不下去，他不能喝了，这个时候我们把那个胆汁啊，猪的胆汁，从灌肠从肛门那面灌进去，灌到大肠里面，大肠有那个胆汁来滋润的话，哇！大下，对不对，所以你不要那么笨，对着肛门，那大下的时候全部喷到你身上，很快的哦，老师那时没有针管你怎么去灌，中国以前用竹管、竹筒、竹子哦抽起来打进去，那现在有那个大的针管，你不要拿针头嘛，圆筒，你不要那么笨嘛，那个针头刺进去一定刺到大肠，你拿个圆筒嘛，比较把猪胆汁吸起来打进去，这时候你用猪胆汁，那你说老师甘油锭，那当然不要用。猪胆，外用的，无所谓，那甘油不要用，我用蜜蜂，有没有，蜜煎导法，圆锥状塞到肛门里去，都可以哦，这是我们外用的通大便的。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170617-xnr6325","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170617-xnr6325","updated":"20240204165951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"象猪肤，我们用猪皮，拿来煮米粉，也是张仲景使用到的，喉咙痛啊，喉咙里头长疮啊，喉咙里头长阴实，化脓都可以使用。"}]}]}